TI  - CHARACTER VARIETIES FOR SL(3, C): THE FIGURE EIGHT KNOT
DA  - D:20141216
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.4711
AB  - We give a description of several representation varieties of the fundamental group of the complement of the ﬁgure eight knot in PGL(3, C) or PSL(3, C). We obtain a description of the projection of the representation variety into the character variety of the boundary torus into SL(3, C).
